OL,3,GNEWSAWidow fears losing home built by  
OL,4,Ahusband after support payments end     
OL,6,FEvery room in Lauren's family home     
OL,7,Freminds her of her late husband.       
OL,9,FA self-employed builder, Andy carried  
OL,10,Fout much of the work on the property   
OL,11,Fhimself, helping create the house where
OL,12,Fthe couple raised their four children. 
OL,14,FNow, more than two years after his     
OL,15,Fdeath from cancer, Lauren fears she may
OL,16,Fstruggle to keep it.                   
OL,18,FThe financial support that helped her  
OL,19,Fcover mortgage payments and household  
OL,20,Fbills has ended, leaving her facing    
OL,21,Funcertainty as she prepares to         
OL,22,Fremortgage the property.               
